  "description": "Translation makes the hole, and the hole is the way. Every empty cell here is the trace of one translation. Three slots along z, crossed only by the cube that made them: plain, turned a quarter on the way, and with the space growing on the way. A slot to the side, along x. Three holes in the front of a plateau, each a lift standing in it: drop in, and rise out on top - plain, turned a quarter, or with the space growing. One slot down through the plateau, a translation along -y and z at once. Mario cubes stand where the holes lead. The exhibits - the axis cubes, the composition workbench, the pick-ups and their gate - say the same thing in matrices.",
